WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.320
They're reading every line.

2
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.720
Grey coats in the glass room.

3
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.540
Red pens. No sleep.

4
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.980
Every hinge, every signature, every key we keep.

5
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.580
We don't touch what they're checking.

6
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.180
Not a bolt. Not a byte.

7
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:26.180
So we take the other hallway, and we build tonight.

8
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.560
Door one is open.

9
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.780
The rest wait in line.

10
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.580
While they read, we build.

11
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.720
While they read, we build.

12
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.960
One door at a time.

13
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.660
Gates, not dates.

14
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.520
While they read, we build.

15
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.860
We build, we build.

16
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:53.480
Gates, not dates.

17
00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.560
One. A light that tells you when your door gets tried.

18
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.580
Two. The signer. Drawn, not built.

19
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.080
Three. Their report, out in the open.

20
00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.540
Four. We build it after the red ink. Never before.

21
00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.360
Five. You build on the bunker.

22
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.380
That's what it's for.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.860
While they read, we build.

24
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.740
While they read, we build.

25
00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.340
Nothing they're checking gets touched.

26
00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.940
Gates, not dates.

27
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.820
While they read, we build.

28
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.720
Still in beta. Doors in order.

29
00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.860
Prepare. Don't panic.
